---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center place-items-center gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-row gap-10">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">INR Project</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="text-left flex flex-col gap-4 md:max-w-5xl">
        <p>
          This is an application I designed for the National Institute of Rehabilitation.
        </p>
        <p>
          My work here was to create designs based on requirements provided by healthcare and rehabilitation professionals.
          The application is used as a tool by healthcare professionals to time and measure the quality of rehab exercises.
          It starts with a patient register screen, where if you have an active patient ID, you can continue with the medical
          process, otherwise you have to register their name and last name.
        </p>
        <p>
          Second step is to select an item to measure with the patient, and then to click play on the timer. This is setup automatically,
          with the system assigning the appropriate alloted time to measure each exercise. The professional can rate the exercises performed by the patient
          with the scale on the right of the timer. The last screen shows the final results that the professional can either choose to keep or discard.
        </p>
        <p>
          I designed the app and its iterations in conjunction with another designer and professional in Human Computer Interaction. We would go back and forth
          on the designs and the requirements, and then we would present our designs to the healthcare professionals for feedback. We would then iterate on the 
          designs based on their feedback and pass it on to the main developer for further implementation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section flex justify-center place-items-center">
    <div class="carousel md:max-w-5xl w-full">
      <div id="item1" class="carousel-item w-full">
        <img src="/src/assets/inr1.png" class="w-full" />
      </div>
      <div id="item2" class="carousel-item w-full">
        <img src="/src/assets/inr2.png" class="w-full" />
      </div>
      <div id="item3" class="carousel-item w-full">
        <img src="/src/assets/inr3.jpg" class="w-full" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex w-full justify-center gap-2 py-2">
      <a href="#item1" class="btn btn-xs">1</a>
      <a href="#item2" class="btn btn-xs">2</a>
      <a href="#item3" class="btn btn-xs">3</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
